  "details": "For example, let's say you have a dropdown that you are trying to mirror onto a TMP_Dropdown (a type which is not allowed in Udon currently) by updating it's value but then have another UI event like a SendCustomEvent (one that is valid). Regardless of the different legalities of each UI event, the SDK purges all events.\n\nIt really should check for which indexes violate the Udon restrictions and only purge those indices instead of everything.\n\nOriginally reported on the ClientSim repository https://github.com/vrchat-community/ClientSim/issues/64",
